IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `flpa-limitation`

-- Foreign Limitation Periods Act 2012, ss 3 to 8 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set and which periods are given (scratchpad gen_foreign-limitation-periods-act-2012.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

